    "predicted_behavior": "Fresh records (age=0) with matching entity and scope gain a large recency bonus (~0.3 vs ~0.015 for age 19), so they rank above stale full-overlap records; the current authoritative evidence enters the top_k window and the model can extract the live value rather than returning UNKNOWN. Raising top_k to 4 keeps the correct record visible even when several stale high-overlap entries compete.",
